{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_900a436f047a","title":"集智俱乐部","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA==&mid=2247738585&idx=1&sn=2d012f9ef919a10412c7fa7570053eb2&chksm=e9ca5ad571572c56a425ab0762d93e5e3a1b1fae3dff915523c5b0658985a55c8ab5197e4b92&scene=126&sessionid=1795635104#rd","description":"关注复杂科学与人工智能的前沿进展、书籍资料、工具文献、交叉前沿等，同时也发布集智俱乐部、集智学园举办的各类讲座、课程等活动相关信息。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"集智俱乐部","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM4VicMW8sROy4mp4kicsCbgPdujTibKFkG2AUMQt9uwRZ5pA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-25T05:56:18.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA%3D%3D:2247738585:1","title":"⾃然·物理学评论：复杂⽣态系统中的临界点","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA==&mid=2247738585&idx=1&sn=2d012f9ef919a10412c7fa7570053eb2&chksm=e9ca5ad571572c56a425ab0762d93e5e3a1b1fae3dff915523c5b0658985a55c8ab5197e4b92&scene=126&sessionid=1795635104#rd","description":"从七种临界机制看生态系统为何突变、如何预警","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FqZtAVROIcHT4xjcCI1UjoicDk0ZTDwHDAz8EUWq1AvTP8bwVvuqGIWoTXsjVLPclpDK34aR2a7oTBAKB2yZeLIXxG6H6qDHzsHiczK855GuNo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-25T05:56:18.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA%3D%3D:2247738585:2","title":"北京师范大学系统科学学院2027年学术学位博士研究生招生简章","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA==&mid=2247738585&idx=2&sn=0c28438ba135859bf8a4e7959caacb2a&chksm=e9e139d9522a6817d7e1920f1fdd69a2cc29325a216a3dcdfbd345a00dd9a7a91d5f127d9b3a&scene=126&sessionid=1795635104#rd","description":"网上报名，2026年12月3日前按要求提交书面材料","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FqZtAVROIcHRMAF9E74Q9Gl99vdMBQFnsib02l6CpcDwUCnI4p7ibhqcSFXMCicMD4AeicRVFVnqbJdM6mbtuBicqBiaNLc2DyBkCC5lEm